    "intro": {
      "zh": "Nintendo Wii U 是任天堂 2012 年发布的第八代家用游戏机，以带 6.2 英寸触屏的 GamePad 手柄与双屏理念为标志，向下兼容 Wii 游戏与周边，虽商业失利却孕育了 Switch，是游戏机厅第八代主机叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Nintendo Wii U, released in 2012, was an eighth-generation home console distinguished by its GamePad touch-screen controller and dual-screen concept, backward compatible with the Wii and the direct precursor to the Switch."
    },
    "era": 2012, "manufacturer": "Nintendo"
  },
